---
title: "cancel (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: projectAdmin invokes cancel()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_results: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_results --> q_revert_late: results already published
    q_revert_late --> [*]: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_check_results --> q_cancel: results not yet published
    q_cancel --> [*]: cancelled = true; emit SaleCancelled()

    note right of q_check_results
        INV-001: Cancellation only allowed before results publication
        INV-002: Once cancelled, investors can recover capital via withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled
    end note
